---
import CaseStudyLayout from "../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title={`Case Study: Quechua App | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="Medical speech data collection platform with React Native, FastAPI, and MinIO."
  titleKey="quechua.meta_title"
  descriptionKey="quechua.meta_desc"
  caseTitle="Medical Audio Platform for Indigenous Languages"
  caseTitleKey="quechua.title"
  category="Distributed Backend • Audio S3"
  role="Backend & Systems Architect"
  roleKey="quechua.role"
  year="2026"
  tags={[
    "Java",
    "Android",
    "FastAPI",
    "PostgreSQL",
    "MinIO (S3)",
    "Audio API",
  ]}
>
  <!-- Notice Box -->
  <div class="info-box emerald">
    <p>
      <strong data-i18n="quechua.notice_title">Project Context:</strong>{" "}
      <span data-i18n="quechua.notice_body">
        This system serves as the core infrastructure for an academic thesis gathering structured Quechua voice datasets. I joined at an intermediate stage to architect the relational database, build the validation pipeline, and engineer the object storage system.
      </span>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Technical Challenge -->
  <h2 data-i18n="quechua.challenge_title">The Technical Challenge</h2>
  <p data-i18n="quechua.challenge_body">
    Field interviewers needed a dependable mobile tool to record patients answering medical prompts in Quechua. Recordings had to be structured, securely uploaded, and routed through a strict validation workflow (linguistic approval/rejection).
  </p>

  <!-- Video Demonstration (Mobile Frame) -->
  <h2 data-i18n="quechua.demo_title">Application Workflow</h2>

  <div class="mobile-video-container">
    <div class="mobile-video-wrapper">
      <video controls muted preload="metadata">
        <source src="/demo-quechua.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        <span data-i18n="action.video_unsupported">Your browser does not support the video tag.</span>
      </video>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p data-i18n="quechua.demo_intro">
    The demonstration highlights the comprehensive business logic implemented:
  </p>

  <ul class="step-list">
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="quechua.step1_title">Authentication & Roles:</strong>{" "}
      <span data-i18n="quechua.step1_body">
        Role-based login routing users to their respective operational dashboard (Interviewer vs. Validator).
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="quechua.step2_title">Audio Gathering (Interviewers):</strong>{" "}
      <span data-i18n="quechua.step2_body">
        Interface presenting clinical prompts, enabling in-app audio recording, local playback verification, and asynchronous transmission to the server.
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="quechua.step3_title">Validation Hub (Linguists):</strong>{" "}
      <span data-i18n="quechua.step3_body">
        Dedicated portal where experts listen to new recordings and update database state machines with Approve or Reject actions.
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong data-i18n="quechua.step4_title">State Tracking:</strong>{" "}
      <span data-i18n="quechua.step4_body">
        Tab navigation querying the backend dynamically to segregate verified, pending, and rejected medical speech assets.
      </span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <!-- Architectural Solutions -->
  <h2 data-i18n="quechua.solution_title">Architecture & Solutions</h2>

  <div class="arch-card">
    <h3 data-i18n="quechua.sol1_title">1. Object Storage with MinIO</h3>
    <p data-i18n-html="quechua.sol1_body">
      Integrated MinIO (S3-compatible) to offload large audio payloads from PostgreSQL, implementing FastAPI endpoints with presigned URLs for secure mobile streaming.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="arch-card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
    <h3 data-i18n="quechua.sol2_title">2. Relational Modeling (PostgreSQL)</h3>
    <p data-i18n="quechua.sol2_body">
      Architected a relational schema covering granular role-based access, clinical prompt catalogs, and immutable validation audit trails.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="arch-card" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
    <h3 data-i18n="quechua.sol3_title">3. Legacy Code Modernization</h3>
    <p data-i18n-html="quechua.sol3_body">
      Refactored Android networking and structured modular FastAPI routers, establishing clean separation of concerns without disrupting approved UI designs.
    </p>
  </div>
</CaseStudyLayout>
